.google.com/local/writereview?placeid=ChIJias8gcgLGToR8JW2s9H7uo8" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" onclick="return rplg_leave_review_window.call(this)">review us on<svg height="16" width="16" role="none"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div class="rpi-slides-root grw-content"><div class="grw-content-inner"><button class="rpi-ltgt rpi-lt grw-prev" tabindex="0"></button><div class="rpi-slides grw-reviews rpi-slides-bite" data-count="10" data-offset="10"><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img loading="lazy" class="grw-img" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVxKIO_IhimAi9rj2COIJr9DYr0gX3cN_bKvW1evjZ4ItLFBrLthw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3" loading="lazy" alt="Asish Kumar Sahu profile picture" width="50" height="50" onerror="if(this.src!='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" ></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109987917384348873215/reviews" class="wp-google-name" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Asish Kumar Sahu</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-time="1736070525">09:48 05 Jan 25</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll" ><span class="wp-google-text">Had a very pleasant experience at the clinic. Dr. Alok is very friendly and all staffs are very supportive.</span></div></div><svg height="16" width="16" role="none"><use href="#grw-google"/></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img loading="lazy" class="grw-img" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUaErFFeJQEITnD3A2sK_vsgarkT21lzb79owoMMt6HrSLNQd4H=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo" loading="lazy" alt="Subham Mohapatra profile picture" width="50" height="50" onerror="if(this.src!='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" ></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116994589386287852960/reviews" class="wp-google-name" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Subham Mohapatra</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-time="1736070042">09:40 05 Jan 25</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll" ></div></div><svg height="16" width="16" role="none"><use href="#grw-google"/></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img loading="lazy" class="grw-img" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLpCAAQ-XMax1DUcJ6nMsuJsD0xkQ59vzXND7Fg-NP3P5i5YA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo" loading="lazy" alt="Sanjib Patra profile picture" width="50" height="50" onerror="if(this.src!='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" ></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111443947155563324092/reviews" class="wp-google-name" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Sanjib Patra</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-time="1731598643">15:37 14 Nov 24</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll" ><span class="wp-google-text">My hair transplantation went very smoothly at Alloroots, bbsr. The entire experience was very good and all staffs are very supportive.</span></div></div><svg height="16" width="16" role="none"><use href="#grw-google"/></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img loading="lazy" class="grw-img" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWuh81zhgGk-Ik7ISPK3lZG5a8tkfwe04b_D5jnQ-R4WKM6mPGI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo" loading="lazy" alt="manas Jeet profile picture" width="50" height="50" onerror="if(this.src!='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" ></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118191170400029095230/reviews" class="wp-google-name" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">manas Jeet</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-time="1731565526">06:25 14 Nov 24</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll" ><span class="wp-google-text">Hi. My self Manas from Talcher, odisha. I did my HT at Alloroots BBSR.. Before reaching there I was confused about things like how the procedure may be or what may the result about HT then I show lots of videos on YouTube related to it.. After researching many times I was confident about the clinic and then I decided to go ahead with the HT treatment and met Dr Alok Sahoo. After discussing we went to HT treatment.. After 80 days I am writing my reviews on it..<br />My hair transplantation went very smooth with small bearable pinchings which Is a normal procedure. The entire experience was very good.. Dr. Sahoo is very friendly and all staffs are very supportive.. After shedding phase I was mixed feelings on my hair density and hair line. Doc has advised me to wait till 5th month and you will feel the result better.Now I am confident about my result..<br />I will give my complete review after full result.Thank you Dr Alok Sahoo and team &#x1f64f;</span></div></div><svg height="16" width="16" role="none"><use href="#grw-google"/></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img loading="lazy" class="grw-img" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVqL5ZRosyO0DKB21PfL8AFRlJQKvOCouhm1rIW7HZntu_45ZFf=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3" loading="lazy" alt="ABHILASH MISHRA profile picture" width="50" height="50" onerror="if(this.src!='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" ></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104123165640197065446/reviews" class="wp-google-name" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">ABHILASH MISHRA</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-time="1730879971">07:59 06 Nov 24</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll" ><span class="wp-google-text">Staff behaviour 10/10<br />Doctor 10/10<br />Results awaiting &#x1f600;</span></div></div><svg height="16" width="16" role="none"><use href="#grw-google"/></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img loading="lazy" class="grw-img" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWc982RcHtFTDTCoy9gC6OURLY_I3aW8kMr838b0x7IYn5-k4c=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo" loading="lazy" alt="SUNIL SAGAR PATRA profile picture" width="50" height="50" onerror="if(this.src!='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" ></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112685058437205454056/reviews" class="wp-google-name" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">SUNIL SAGAR PATRA</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-time="1730868951">04:55 06 Nov 24</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll" ><span class="wp-google-text">The best in odisha for hair</span></div></div><svg height="16" width="16" role="none"><use href="#grw-google"/></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img loading="lazy" class="grw-img" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIeLODiiHYeyh9USVBuKG6Fjmcpy3EcZbPai8zwRXHgeS7kWw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo" loading="lazy" alt="Subas Barik profile picture" width="50" height="50" onerror="if(this.src!='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" ></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111588494678512499397/reviews" class="wp-google-name" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Subas Barik</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-time="1725349458">07:44 03 Sep 24</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll" ><span class="wp-google-text">Thanks.. Alloroot. I am very happy with the service. All team members are very good, well behavior. You feel like your own familiar atmosphere. I like to recommend the best hair transplant doctor in Bhubaneswar.</span></div></div><svg height="16" width="16" role="none"><use href="#grw-google"/></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img loading="lazy" class="grw-img" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW52RB_5B7Qt5Y7mhg3cqI0TmJaa_DQEcAOlhqgZ8VQKqDhH0Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo" loading="lazy" alt="SupesCoding profile picture" width="50" height="50" onerror="if(this.src!='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" ></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110728196123017740679/reviews" class="wp-google-name" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">SupesCoding</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-time="1725029281">14:48 30 Aug 24</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll" ><span class="wp-google-text">Impressed with the Alloroot clinic! Professional staff, clean environment, and effective treatment. The dermatologist was skilled and addressed my concerns well. Recommend this clinic because they have the best doctors in Bhubaneswar.</span></div></div><svg height="16" width="16" role="none"><use href="#grw-google"/></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img loading="lazy" class="grw-img" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVVsMfM7olLYZIzffZLqt4nGo_zZi4S20jrJdDwCkQ_hP9PH3YK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo" loading="lazy" alt="Pratik NAYAK profile picture" width="50" height="50" onerror="if(this.src!='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" ></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105096539895456951686/reviews" class="wp-google-name" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Pratik NAYAK</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-time="1724514951">15:55 24 Aug 24</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll" ><span class="wp-google-text">I couldn't be happier with the results of my hair transplant! Alloroot has the best hair transplant doctor in Bhubaneswar city. They took the time to understand my concerns and needs, and the procedure was painless and efficient. The staff was incredibly friendly and supportive throughout the entire process. I highly recommend Dr. [Doctor's Name] to anyone considering a hair transplant.</span></div></div><svg height="16" width="16" role="none"><use href="#grw-google"/></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img loading="lazy" class="grw-img" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXujB5x9HnTNrgBYbRtu4VSgJsNqNHVHoh1ZMfOxgOVClah_msR4Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4" loading="lazy" alt="Benugopal profile picture" width="50" height="50" onerror="if(this.src!='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://alloroots.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" ></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103825010073411257325/reviews" class="wp-google-name" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Benugopal</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-time="1714125670">10:01 26 Apr 24</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll" ><span class="wp-google-text">I did my hair reconstruction in Alloroots by Dr Alok sahoo this week and here is my review<br /><br />1. Place was very spacious and was having dedicated rooms for procedure, relaxation &amp;  consultation<br /><br />2. Ambience was very nice and peaceful<br /><br />3. Amenities like drinking water, rest room all were present<br /><br />4. Staffs were very friendly small to small things were taken care of before asking.<br /><br />About the transplant-<br />1. Procedure was done with optimum breaks which was very relaxing with chill background music.<br /><br />2. Procedure Was not at all painful though time taking.<br /><br />3. Aseptic measures were highly maintained<br /><br />4. Doctor was very friendly and very meticulous about the reconstruction , he asked me what is my need according to that he did many designs over my scalp and gave me options which design I like according to that he finalized that.. all through the procedure doctor was there and did all the things like extraction, slit making &amp; implantation by himself and after procedure the look was exactly matching the design done on markers.<br /><br />5. Post procedural measures like dressing, caps , masks, medicine and everything was taken care of without asking and have been explained very clearly what to do , what not to by the staffs..<br /><br />In all total , I was very satisfied with the procedure and look he gave me.. the scalp was so clean no oozing or crusting were there...<br />waiting for the results .. and hope for the best &#x263a;&#xfe0f; &#x263a;&#xfe0f;</span></div></div><svg height="16" width="16" role="none"><use href="#grw-google"/></svg></div></div></div><button class="rpi-ltgt rpi-gt grw-next" tabindex="0"></button><div class="rpi-dots-wrap"><div class="rpi-dots"></div></div></div></div></div><script data-cfasync="false" src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js"></script><script>(function(p){if(!p)return;let w=p.offsetWidth,m=function(a,b){return Math.min(a,b)===a};p.querySelector('.grw-row').classList.replace('grw-row-m','grw-row-'+(m(w,510)?'xs':m(w,750)?'x':m(w,1100)?'s':m(w,1450)?'m':m(w,1800)?'l':'xl'))})(document.currentScript?.parentElement)</script></div></div>
				</div>
